Your mastery of necromancy becomes so total that an aura of undeath radiates around you in radius [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)].

Any undead minion standing inside of it is protected, increasing all their resistances by [8%, 11%, 13%, 16%, 18% (TL1-5)].

In addition when you create new minions they inherit [17%, 24%, 29%, 33%, 36% (TL1-5)] of your spellpower (applied to any powers), spell crit chance (applied to any crit chances), saves, resists and damage increases (applied to all elements).
